{"id":"62a415c2a285633a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-semi-filter.md","title":"Semifilter","display":"df-semi-filter — Semifilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semi-filter","aliases":["58-df-semi-filter"],"display":"df-semi-filter — Semifilter","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semi-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semi-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semi-filter — Semifilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的无限子集族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semifilter}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Semifilter}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（此处定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semi\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semifilter}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall B\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(|A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega\\to B\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semi\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semifilter}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall B\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(|A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega\\to B\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Semifilter 是非空的无限子集族，并对 almost supersets 向上封闭；“almost” 条件已在断言中展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega\">\\(|A\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>非空性与向上闭性推出所有余有限子集都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>一般 semifilter 不要求对有限交封闭；加入该条件才接近 free filter。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semifilter}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semi\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semifilter}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall B\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\bigl(|A\\setminus B|<\\omega\\to B\\in\\mathcal S\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"|A\\setminus B|<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false}],"bytes":1022,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-semi-filter.md|58-df-semi-filter]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb"]}